:repo
:desc          0.13.0.101-110 历史变更归档，主 CHANGELOG 仅保留当前活跃版本线
:version       0.13.0.110-dev
:last_update   2026/05/31

:history

    0.13.0.110-dev - 2026/05/31 (717087a3) [fix/mcp-tool-binding-test-isolation]
        :brief 缺少模型审稿结果阻断 final export
        :verification
            - fix(review): runMultiModelReview 在 model_reviews 为空时输出 missing_model_review blocker
            - fix(review): final gate 不再把没有任何模型审稿结果的稿件视为 review pass
            - test(authoring): 新增 evaluateVerificationGate 用例，确认无模型审稿时 blocking_report.status=blocked
        :checks
            - npx --yes bun@1.3.13 --cwd packages/opencode test test/paper/authoring.test.ts --test-name-pattern "no model review|verified paper reference|formal References"
            - npx --yes bun@1.3.13 --cwd packages/opencode test test/paper/authoring.test.ts test/paper/datasets.test.ts test/paper/live-benchmark-quality.test.ts test/paper/code-metadata-version.test.ts --test-name-pattern "no model review|verified paper reference|formal References|source records|source record manifest|complete code-paper|placeholder datasets|blocks final data checks|dataset discovery|renders ranking benchmark|renders ranking related work|placeholder literature|distinct representatives|live paper quality|prefers product README version|retries retryable temporary directory cleanup"
            - npx --yes bun@1.3.13 run --cwd packages/opencode typecheck

